### Packaging and Installation

- Local dependencies provided as wheels: [handle_sdk-2.0.0-py3-none-any.whl](mdc:handle_sdk-2.0.0-py3-none-any.whl), [pygard-0.1.2-py3-none-any.whl](mdc:pygard-0.1.2-py3-none-any.whl).
- Install order:
  1) `pip install handle_sdk-2.0.0-py3-none-any.whl pygard-0.1.2-py3-none-any.whl`
  2) `pip install -e .` (or use [dist/](mdc:dist) artifacts)
  3) For UI, `pip install gradio pandas`
- Main distribution artifacts in [dist/](mdc:dist).
- Use [BUILD.md](mdc:BUILD.md) for build steps and [requirements.txt](mdc:requirements.txt) for base deps.
